WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.850
Ryu uses the recorded incoming jump toward grounded Ingrid.

2
00:00:01.850 --> 00:00:03.350
Back heavy punch and its heavy-punch target continuation intercept him.

3
00:00:03.350 --> 00:00:04.600
Heavy Sun Flare uses the two visible Crests to extend the airborne route.

4
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:05.650
Raw Rush forward heavy punch reaches the launched Ryu.

5
00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:06.050
Medium Sun Flare finishes the anti-air conversion.
